              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When you're running a trucking operation, every purchase has to pull its weight. Equipment decisions aren't about trends; they're about reliability, longevity, and return on investment. That's why more owner-operators and fleet managers are choosing used dry van trailers for sale instead of buying new.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At <a href=\"/locations/trailer-sales\">Sun State Trailers</a>, we work with Florida businesses every day that want dependable equipment without overspending. Buying used doesn't mean cutting corners; it means buying smart. When you know what to look for and who to buy from, used dry van trailers can deliver years of performance while keeping more money in your business.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-financial-sense",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why Used Dry Van Trailers Make Financial Sense",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "financial-sense"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-financial-sense-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Dry van trailers are workhorses. They're built to haul freight efficiently, protect cargo, and hold up mile after mile. Because of that durability, many dry vans still have plenty of life left long after their first owner is done with them.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-financial-sense-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Choosing a used option allows you to:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-financial-sense-3",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "mark": "dot",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Lower upfront costs compared to buying new"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Reduce depreciation loss"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Expand or replace equipment faster"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Maintain flexibility as your business grows"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-resale-value",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Understanding Dry Van Resale Value",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "resale-value"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-resale-value-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "One of the biggest advantages of used dry vans is the strong dry van resale value. Because these trailers are always in demand, they tend to hold value better than many specialized trailer types.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-resale-value-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Several factors influence resale value:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "list-resale-value-3",
                  "type": "prose-list",
                  "props": {
                    "ordered": false,
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Overall structural integrity"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Age and mileage"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Spec variations"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-resale-value-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Well-maintained dry van trailers, especially those that have been inspected and reconditioned, often retain solid resale potential if you decide to upgrade later. That makes them a practical choice for owner-operators who think long-term and want equipment that supports future flexibility.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "fig-1",
                  "type": "image",
                  "props": {
                    "width": "full",
                    "image": {
                      "src": "/img/blog/why-you-should-shop-used-dry-van-trailers-for-sale/1.jpg",
                      "width": 1280,
                      "height": 853,
                      "alt": "Sun State technician inspecting a used dry van trailer's electrical connections with a clipboard"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-what-to-look-for",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "What to Look for in Used Dry Van Trailers",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "what-to-look-for"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-to-look-for-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Not all used trailers are created equal. That's why it's important to understand what separates quality used dry van trailers from units that may cost more in repairs down the road.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-to-look-for-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When evaluating a used dry van, pay close attention to:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cards-what-to-look-for-3",
                  "type": "card-lists",
                  "props": {
                    "variant": "type",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "title": "Roof and Wall Condition",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "Look for leaks, cracks, or prior damage."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Floor Integrity",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "Solid flooring is critical for safety and cargo protection."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Door Operation",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "Smooth, secure doors prevent delays and damage."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Suspension and Brakes",
                        "points": [],
                        "intro": "These components impact both safety and longevity."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-to-look-for-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State Trailers, used dry van trailers are inspected with performance and safety in mind. The goal isn't just to sell equipment; it's to make sure what you drive off with supports your business without surprises.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "actions-what-to-look-for-5",
                  "type": "buttons",
                  "props": {
                    "align": "left",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "ctaId": "browse-used-trailers",
                        "label": "See Our Used Trailer Inventory",
                        "style": "primary"
                      },
                      {
                        "ctaId": "browse-trailers",
