                        "style": "secondary"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-local-dealer",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Buying a Used Trailer in Tampa and Central Florida",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "local-dealer"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-local-dealer-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "For Florida-based operations, buying from a local dealer matters. Choosing a used trailer Tampa supplier means you get access to regional expertise, faster support, and inventory that's suited for Florida roads and conditions.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-local-dealer-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Working with a local partner also means:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "list-local-dealer-3",
                  "type": "prose-list",
                  "props": {
                    "ordered": false,
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Easier access to inventory and walkthroughs"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Clear communication with real people"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Support beyond the initial sale"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-local-dealer-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Sun State Trailers has built long-standing relationships with owner-operators and fleets across the state by staying straightforward, dependable, and focused on customer success, not one-time transactions.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "fig-2",
                  "type": "image",
                  "props": {
                    "width": "full",
                    "image": {
                      "src": "/img/blog/why-you-should-shop-used-dry-van-trailers-for-sale/2.jpg",
                      "width": 1280,
                      "height": 853,
                      "alt": "Row of used Hyundai Translead dry van trailers at the Sun State Trailers lot"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-why-sunstate",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why Sun State Trailers Is a Trusted Source for Used Dry Vans",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "why-sunstate"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-sunstate-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State Trailers, the difference isn't just inventory; it's experience. The team understands how important dependable equipment is to keeping your operation moving. That's why every used dry van trailer is approached with the same care and transparency customers expect from a long-term partner.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-sunstate-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "<strong>What sets Sun State Trailers apart:</strong>",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "list-why-sunstate-3",
                  "type": "prose-list",
                  "props": {
                    "ordered": false,
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Straightforward guidance without pressure"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Carefully evaluated used inventory"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Access to specifications and details upfront"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "A team that values long-term relationships"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-sunstate-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "This approach reflects Sun State Trailers' commitment to professionalism, reliability, and community values that show up in every interaction.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-sunstate-5",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If you're ready to invest in equipment that works as hard as you do, used dry van trailers are a smart place to start. <a href=\"/store/inventory?type=trailer\">Explore inventory</a> to find available used dry van trailers for sale, or download trailer specifications to make an informed decision that supports your business today, and down the road.",
                    "align": "left",
